WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:03.480
The word Shi'a means
the party, or followers,

2
00:00:03.530 --> 00:00:06.000
of Ali, the Prophet's cousin.

3
00:00:06.050 --> 00:00:08.960
Shi'a Muslims believe
that, after the Prophet,

4
00:00:09.010 --> 00:00:13.090
God appointed Imams from his
family to guide the community.

5
00:00:13.140 --> 00:00:18.170
For most Shi'a, the last of those guides
has been hidden by God for over 1,000

6
00:00:18.220 --> 00:00:19.280
years.

7
00:00:19.330 --> 00:00:21.290
So who leads them now?

8
00:00:21.340 --> 00:00:26.570
In this mission, you'll find out what Shi'a
Muslims believe makes someone an Imam.

9
00:00:26.620 --> 00:00:30.610
Then you'll read two verses from
the Qur'an that Shi'a scholars cite,

10
00:00:30.660 --> 00:00:33.560
and see how Sunnis read them differently.

11
00:00:33.610 --> 00:00:38.790
Your mission: find out who guides most
Shi'a Muslims while their Imam is hidden,

12
00:00:38.840 --> 00:00:39.550
and why.
